---
source: tests/journey/settings.rs
expression: output
---
$ pace config set week-start mondy   # at 09:00
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × `mondy` is not a day of the week
  help: did you mean `monday`?


$ pace config set most-recent-count 0   # at 09:00
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × `0` is not a whole number from 1
  help: write a number like `9`


$ pace config set storage.split fortnight   # at 09:00
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × `fortnight` is not a split
  help: split by `year`, `month`, `week` or `day`


$ pace config set time-zon Europe/Vienna   # at 09:00
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × pace doesn't know the setting `time-zon`
  help: did you mean `time-zone`?


$ pace config set project-paths ~/repo   # at 09:00
success: false
exit_code: 2
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × `project-paths` is a table of directories, not one setting
  help: edit [project-paths] in [SANDBOX]/config/pace.global.toml
